<title>DENMARK: Denmark's Superfos buys Sweden'S APCO.</title>
<headline>Denmark's Superfos buys Sweden'S APCO.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish chemicals group Superfos said on Thursday that it had bought, for an undisclosed amount, Swedish contract aerosol-filler APCO.</p>
<p>A Superfos statement said that APCO had 70 employees and an annual turnover of around 100 million Swedish crowns.</p>
